{"kind": "mod", "id": 2799, "name": "SPTarkov ModOrganizer 2 Plugin", "slug": "sptarkov-modorganizer-2-plugin", "teaser": "Adds Mod Organizer 2 support for SPT 4.x", "owner_name": "nadeko11", "downloads": 1363, "favourites": 14, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.nadeko.sptmo2pluginv4", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Tools", "category_id": 1, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:36:25.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-07-05T13:42:39.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-07-05T13:48:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "^4.0.13 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Manage SPT 4.x mods with Mod Organizer 2. Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/964/spt-modorganizer-integration\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT ModOrganizer Integration</a>.</p>\n<p>Please report any problems in the comments.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds a <strong>Launch SPT</strong> button that starts the SPT server, then opens the launcher when it is ready.</li>\n<li>Adds separate <strong>SPT Server</strong> and <strong>SPT Launcher</strong> entries for troubleshooting.</li>\n<li>Installs client mods to <code>BepInEx/plugins</code>.</li>\n<li>Installs server mods to <code>SPT/user/mods</code>.</li>\n<li>Keeps your profiles, logs, launcher data, certificates, and settings in your real SPT folder.</li>\n<li>Keeps server mods managed by MO2, so you can enable or disable them without manually moving files.</li>\n<li>Recognizes common SPT mod archive layouts during installation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mod Organizer 2 2.5.x</li>\n<li>SPT 4.x</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Extract the plugin into your Mod Organizer 2 installation folder.</li>\n<li>Start MO2 and create or select an SPT instance.</li>\n<li>When MO2 asks for your game folder, select your SPT client root.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Choose the folder that contains:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>EscapeFromTarkov.exe</code></li>\n<li><code>BepInEx</code></li>\n<li><code>winhttp.dll</code></li>\n<li><code>SPT</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>For example, choose <code>C:\\Games\\SPT</code>, not <code>C:\\Games\\SPT\\SPT</code>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "^4.0.13 <4.1.0", "content_length": 2992, "downloads": 171, "published_at": "2026-07-05T13:47:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2799/sptarkov-modorganizer-2-plugin/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "^4.0.13 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3075, "downloads": 103, "published_at": "2026-07-06T08:23:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2799/sptarkov-modorganizer-2-plugin/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "^4.0.13 <4.1.0", "content_length": 3315, "downloads": 251, "published_at": "2026-07-06T16:02:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2799/sptarkov-modorganizer-2-plugin/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "^4.0.13 <4.1.0", "content_length": 4120, "downloads": 838, "published_at": "2026-07-10T13:41:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2799/sptarkov-modorganizer-2-plugin/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/AJCristi/SPT-ModOrganizer-ext", "label": "Github Repo"}]}